# "Whenever you draw your second card each turn": turn 3's draw step is the first card and Opt's draw is the second, so the
# ability triggers with Ornithopter and Wurmwall Sweeper on the battlefield. The creature slot refuses Mox Sapphire (an
# artifact, not a creature) and takes Bot2's Llanowar Elves (any creature, whoever controls it); the Spacecraft slot takes
# the Sweeper, leaving the other Spacecraft (Synthesizer Labship) alone: one +1/+1 counter and exactly two charge counters.

